  "title": "Lument Finance Trust Reports 2025 Results",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, March 23, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Lument Finance Trust, Inc. (NYSE: LFT) (“we”, “LFT” or “the Company”) today reported its fourth quarter and full year 2025 results. GAAP net loss attributable to common shareholders for the fourth quarter was $(8.9) million, or $(0.17) per share of common stock, and for the full year was $(7.5) million, or $(0.14)",
